{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54438","headline":"智异山花开洞 · 崔致远","name":"智异山花开洞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东国花开洞，壶中别有天。\n仙人推玉枕，身世倏千年。\n（见赵书印编《韩国文苑》卷七，注出《择里志》题注云：「宣庙时有僧得之岩石间云。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔致远","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54438.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54438","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}